<title>CROATIA: Croatian January output stagnant, down 0.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian January output stagnant, down 0.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    JANUARY   DEC '96    JAN '96</p>
<p> Monthly change pct		 0.0	-14.1	 +4.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     -0.4	 +1.2	 +4.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		 96.6	 96.6	100.0</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data include estimates for Serbs-held Eastern Slavonia, where production amounted to two percent of the total before 1991. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
